Package: nisone
Title: Inference for Samples of Size at Least One
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("David", 
           "Gerard",
           email = "gerard.1787@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"), 
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9450-5023"))
Description: Provides different interval estimates of a location parameter
    when the sample size is one or more. These include classical methods
    when n=1, new Bayesian analogues of these classical methods, and extensions
    of these methods to larger sample sizes in the normal case. Other functions
    calculate Bayes factors based on t-statistics, and implement of the 
    (generalized) inverse normal distribution.
